<title>USA: Eckerd holders approve Penney merger.</title>
<headline>Eckerd holders approve Penney merger.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Penney Co on Thursday said Eckerd Corp shareholders approved the company's merger with Omega Acquisition Corp, a wholly owned subsidiary of J.C. Penney.</p>
<p>The approval at a special shareholders meeting marks the final step in the company's acquisition of Eckerd.</p>
<p>As a result of the merger, Eckerd stockholders will receive 0.6604 of a share of J.C. Penney common stock for each share of Eckerd common. The deal was valued at $3.3 billion.</p>
</text>
